ked to another realm\u2014toss items in, and they\u2019ll turn into currency.<br>(<i>Except Sprites.</i> They hate it here.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282520/extras/aab9c3ceb28ed4108d33dadbb1aa486c.poster.avif?t=1753083816\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282520/extras/aab9c3ceb28ed4108d33dadbb1aa486c.webm?t=1753083816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282520/extras/aab9c3ceb28ed4108d33dadbb1aa486c.mp4?t=1753083816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sprites and Their Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The bird on the crate recycles star coins\u2026 which means it SELLS stuff.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does a bird sell things? Why does it have an interdimensional backpack? And why are Sprites inside?<br>Don\u2019t ask questions\u2014just buy the Sprites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282520/extras/cbc64108ff6c68f683d20a70be6bcd2f.poster.avif?t=1753083816\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282520/extras/cbc64108ff6c68f683d20a70be6bcd2f.webm?t=1753083816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282520/extras/cbc64108ff6c68f683d20a70be6bcd2f.mp4?t=1753083816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy Your Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No